      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that helps reframe it. but some people are saying that \"social justice\" in a corporate setting is just a way to push a specific political agenda that has nothing to do with business. they say it's basically just virtue signaling to appease a certain demographic. do you think there's any merit to the idea that firms should just stay out of politics entirely and stick to the math?",
